WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.655 --> 00:00:04.391
ILLEGAL CRIMINALS AND THE

00:00:02.622 --> 00:00:04.925
SAFETY OF THE COMMUNITIES.

00:00:04.524 --> 00:00:06.026
KATIE?

00:00:05.125 --> 00:00:07.460
&gt;&gt; THANKS SO MUCH.

00:00:06.159 --> 00:00:10.230
JOINING US NOW IS THE MAN AT

00:00:07.594 --> 00:00:11.932
THE CENTER OF THE STORY.

00:00:10.363 --> 00:00:14.701
ESCONDIDO MAYOR, REPUBLICAN,

00:00:12.065 --> 00:00:15.001
AND THE BIERKLY, CALIFORNIA,

00:00:14.835 --> 00:00:16.069
MAYOR.

00:00:15.135 --> 00:00:17.771
THANK YOU BOTH SO MUCH.

00:00:16.203 --> 00:00:19.172
I SHOULD KNOW THE BERKELEY

00:00:17.904 --> 00:00:20.340
MAYOR IS A DEMOCRAT SUPPORTING

00:00:19.306 --> 00:00:22.809
THE SANCTUARY POLICIES.

00:00:20.473 --> 00:00:23.109
BUT FIRST, I WANT TO GO TO

00:00:22.943 --> 00:00:24.811
YOU.

00:00:23.243 --> 00:00:26.813
YOU TOOK THE OATH OF OFFICE AS

00:00:24.945 --> 00:00:28.114
AN CITIZEN COMING TO THE

00:00:26.947 --> 00:00:29.416
COUNTRY AS AN IMMIGRANT.

00:00:28.248 --> 00:00:31.218
EXPLAIN TO ME HOW IT PLAYS IN

00:00:29.549 --> 00:00:33.119
YOUR DECISION TONIGHT TO BE

00:00:31.351 --> 00:00:35.222
AGAINST THE SANCTUARY LAWS

00:00:33.253 --> 00:00:37.290
COMING OUT OF SACRAMENTO.

00:00:35.422 --> 00:00:37.824
&gt;&gt; I TOOK THE OATH TWICE,

00:00:37.424 --> 00:00:40.360
KATIE.

00:00:37.958 --> 00:00:41.494
FIRST, WHEN I BECAME CITIZEN,

00:00:40.493 --> 00:00:42.762
IN 1990.

00:00:41.628 --> 00:00:45.131
AND THEN SECOND TIME WHEN I

00:00:42.896 --> 00:00:45.498
WAS ELECTED COUNCILMAN IN

00:00:45.265 --> 00:00:47.567
2004.

00:00:45.632 --> 00:00:50.770
AND LAST TIME WHEN I WAS

00:00:47.701 --> 00:00:52.205
ELECTED MAYOR IN 2010.

00:00:50.904 --> 00:00:53.874
I CAME THIS THIS COUNTRY TO

00:00:52.339 --> 00:00:56.810
KEEP MY FAMILY SAFE.

00:00:54.007 --> 00:00:59.379
AND I SEE MYSELF HERE FIGHTING

00:00:56.943 --> 00:01:03.516
FOR THE SAFETY OF MY FAMILY.

00:00:59.512 --> 00:01:04.918
AND THE FAMILIES OF ESCONDIDO.

00:01:03.650 --> 00:01:05.385
I HAVE 150,000 OF OUR

00:01:05.051 --> 00:01:07.187
RESIDENTS.

00:01:05.518 --> 00:01:08.255
OUR RELATIONSHIP WITH I.C.E.

00:01:07.320 --> 00:01:10.657
HAS WORKED PERFECTLY.

00:01:08.388 --> 00:01:11.057
THE I.C.E. AGENT HAVE MADE MY

00:01:10.790 --> 00:01:13.360
CASE.

00:01:11.191 --> 00:01:16.463
AND WE HAVE DEPORTED OVER

00:01:13.493 --> 00:01:17.764
2,000 ILLEGAL CRIMINALS FOR

00:01:16.596 --> 00:01:19.165
FROM OUR CITY WITH OUR

00:01:17.898 --> 00:01:22.002
COOPERATION WITH I.C.E.

00:01:19.299 --> 00:01:24.471
WE FOCUS ON CRIMINALS ONLY.

00:01:22.135 --> 00:01:26.172
NOW THE I.C.E. AGENTS ARE ON

00:01:24.604 --> 00:01:26.573
THEIR OWN AND IN THE

00:01:26.306 --> 00:01:29.943
COMMUNITY.

00:01:26.706 --> 00:01:33.847
AND IN OUR NEIGHBORHOOD, AT

00:01:30.076 --> 00:01:34.781
OUR STATIONS PICKING UP

00:01:33.980 --> 00:01:36.016
CRIMINALS AND INNOCENT PEOPLE.

00:01:34.915 --> 00:01:38.251
AS A RESULT OF OUR COOPERATION

00:01:36.149 --> 00:01:41.855
WITH I.C.E. THE CRIME IN

00:01:38.385 --> 00:01:43.089
ESCONDIDO WENT DOWN BY 33%.

00:01:41.988 --> 00:01:44.991
ESCONDIDO TODAY AS SAFE AS IT

00:01:43.223 --> 00:01:48.962
WAS IN 1980.

00:01:45.125 --> 00:01:50.096
I WAS ELECTED MAYOR TO UPHOLD

00:01:49.095 --> 00:01:52.799
THE CONSTITUTION AND ALSO TO

00:01:50.230 --> 00:01:54.968
KEEP MY COMMUNITY SAFE.

00:01:52.933 --> 00:01:56.403
THIS RESOLUTION TO FIGHT THE

00:01:55.101 --> 00:01:58.772
SANCTUARY LAW IS AT THE CORE

00:01:56.536 --> 00:02:00.273
OF MY MISSION.

00:01:58.972 --> 00:02:01.074
&gt;&gt; SO I WANT TO GET YOUR

00:02:00.407 --> 00:02:03.243
RESPONSE TO THAT.

00:02:01.207 --> 00:02:04.945
THE MAYOR OF ESCONDIDO IS

00:02:03.376 --> 00:02:06.346
SAYING THEY HAD 2,000 CRIMINAL

00:02:05.078 --> 00:02:07.247
ALIENS THEY DEPORTED FROM

00:02:06.479 --> 00:02:08.448
THEIR COMMUNITY WHICH WOULD BE

00:02:07.380 --> 00:02:10.383
ON THE STREET IF SACRAMENTO

00:02:08.581 --> 00:02:11.584
HAD ITS WAY BY BANNING LOCAL

00:02:10.517 --> 00:02:12.419
LAW ENFORCEMENT FROM WORKING

00:02:11.718 --> 00:02:14.354
WITH THE CENTRAL GOVERNMENT.

00:02:12.552 --> 00:02:14.721
WHAT DO YOU HAVE TO SAY ABOUT

00:02:14.487 --> 00:02:15.956
THAT?

00:02:14.854 --> 00:02:17.357
WHY SHOULD 2,000 CRIMINAL

00:02:16.089 --> 00:02:17.757
ALIENS STILL BE IN THE

00:02:17.490 --> 00:02:20.093
COMMUNITIES?

00:02:17.958 --> 00:02:21.227
&gt;&gt; WELL, I THINK IT'S

00:02:20.226 --> 00:02:22.862
IMPORTANT TO DEFINE WHAT YOU

00:02:21.361 --> 00:02:24.564
MEAN BY "CRIMINAL."

00:02:22.996 --> 00:02:25.465
CERTAINLY VIOLATION OF THE

00:02:24.698 --> 00:02:27.400
FEDERAL, CIVIL, IMMIGRATION

00:02:25.598 --> 00:02:31.004
LAW IS A CRIME.

00:02:27.534 --> 00:02:33.273
WE ARE TALKING ABOUT PEOPLE

00:02:31.137 --> 00:02:34.474
WHO ARE VICTIMS OF A BROKEN

00:02:33.406 --> 00:02:36.810
IMMIGRATION SYSTEM?

00:02:34.607 --> 00:02:37.978
IN ESCONDIDO THEY HAVE A RIGHT

00:02:36.943 --> 00:02:38.979
TOO TAKE A POSITION ON THE

00:02:38.111 --> 00:02:40.180
ISSUES FOR THEIR COMMUNITY BUT

00:02:39.112 --> 00:02:41.514
THEY DON'T SPEAK FOR BERKELEY

00:02:40.313 --> 00:02:42.082
AND THEY DON'T SPEAK FOR THE

00:02:41.648 --> 00:02:43.116
STATE OF CALIFORNIA.

00:02:42.215 --> 00:02:44.417
THERE ARE MANY CITIES IN THE

00:02:43.249 --> 00:02:45.819
BAY AREA AND THE STATE OF

00:02:44.551 --> 00:02:47.287
CALIFORNIA THAT BELIEVE THAT

00:02:45.952 --> 00:02:48.088
SANCTUARY POLICIES MAKE

00:02:47.420 --> 00:02:50.290
COMMUNITIES SAFER.

00:02:48.221 --> 00:02:51.424
FOR EXAMPLE, IN MY CITY, CRIME

00:02:50.423 --> 00:02:51.791
HAS GONE DOWN IN THE LAST TEN

00:02:51.558 --> 00:02:53.393
YEARS.

00:02:51.925 --> 00:02:54.961
EVEN WITH THE SANCTUARY

00:02:53.526 --> 00:02:56.363
POLICY, OUR POLICE ARE STILL

00:02:55.095 --> 00:02:56.730
COOPERATING WITH THE FEDERAL

00:02:56.496 --> 00:02:58.298
AGENCIES.

00:02:56.863 --> 00:02:59.799
THERE WAS AN OPERATION IN MY

00:02:58.431 --> 00:03:01.568
CITY A COUPLE OF WEEKS AGO

00:02:59.933 --> 00:03:02.869
WHERE HOMELAND SECURITY

00:03:01.701 --> 00:03:05.271
INVESTIGATIONS ARRESTED AN

00:03:03.003 --> 00:03:08.174
ILLEGAL IMMIGRANT WHO WAS

00:03:05.405 --> 00:03:09.476
ENGAGED IN DRUG CRIME.

00:03:08.375 --> 00:03:10.677
&gt;&gt; THE LOCAL POLICE IN

00:03:09.609 --> 00:03:12.278
BERKELEY -- IT'S NICE THAT THE

00:03:10.810 --> 00:03:13.413
LOCAL POLICE OF BERKELEY ARE

00:03:12.412 --> 00:03:14.848
TRYING TO STOP ILLEGAL

00:03:13.546 --> 00:03:17.017
CRIMINAL ALIENS WITH THOSE

00:03:14.981 --> 00:03:21.554
CRIMES.

00:03:17.150 --> 00:03:22.756
IF YOU WANT GET INTO THAT

00:03:21.688 --> 00:03:24.324
GOVERNOR BROWN HAD FIVE

00:03:22.889 --> 00:03:26.693
CRIMINAL ALIENS WITH VIOLENT

00:03:24.457 --> 00:03:28.528
RECORDS LIKE DOMESTIC

00:03:26.826 --> 00:03:30.263
VIOLENCE, ARMED ROBBERY, THEFT

00:03:28.661 --> 00:03:31.798
AND ROBBERY, CARRYING OUT

00:03:30.397 --> 00:03:33.867
CRIMES WITH THE HANDGUN.

00:03:31.931 --> 00:03:34.734
MAYOR ABED, WHAT IS YOUR

00:03:34.868 --> 00:03:38.271
MUNICIPALITIES ALLOWING THESE

00:03:36.069 --> 00:03:39.272
CRIMINAL ALIENS TO CONTINUE TO

00:03:38.405 --> 00:03:40.340
OPERATE INSIDE CALIFORNIA?

00:03:39.406 --> 00:03:41.374
BECAUSE THEY CAN JUST DRIVE

00:03:40.473 --> 00:03:43.843
DOWN TO WHERE YOU ARE.

00:03:41.508 --> 00:03:44.210
IT'S NOT LIKE THERE IS A

00:03:43.977 --> 00:03:47.280
BORDER.

00:03:44.411 --> 00:03:49.416
&gt;&gt; I THINK THIS IS A RISK THAT

00:03:47.414 --> 00:03:50.817
NOT ONLY ESCONDIDO BUT EVERY

00:03:49.549 --> 00:03:53.186
CITY IN CALIFORNIA.

00:03:50.950 --> 00:03:54.621
AND EVERY STATE IN THE NATION.

00:03:53.319 --> 00:03:57.157
THIS MAYOR IS IN DENIAL.

00:03:54.754 --> 00:03:58.458
THEY WANT TO GIVE SANCTUARY TO

00:03:57.290 --> 00:04:00.960
ILLEGAL CRIMINALS.

00:03:58.591 --> 00:04:02.929
GIVING SANCTUARY TO ILLEGAL

00:04:01.094 --> 00:04:04.764
CRIMINALS AND GIVING THEM MORE

00:04:03.063 --> 00:04:07.367
RIGHTS AND PROTECT THE RIGHTS

00:04:04.898 --> 00:04:09.736
MORE THAN THE CITIZENS IS JUST

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:10.236
IMMORAL, IT'S ILLEGAL AND

00:04:09.869 --> 00:04:12.772
UNCONSTITUTIONAL.

00:04:10.370 --> 00:04:14.174
WE NEED TO KEEP OUR COMMUNITY

00:04:12.906 --> 00:04:15.608
SAFE.

00:04:14.307 --> 00:04:17.177
SB-52, THE SINK WARE STATE

00:04:15.742 --> 00:04:21.748
WILL GIVE -- SANCTUARY STATE

00:04:17.310 --> 00:04:22.148
WILL GIVE THE IMMIGRANTS LESS

00:04:21.881 --> 00:04:23.716
PROTECTION.

00:04:22.282 --> 00:04:24.551
BECAUSE I.C.E. WILL BE IN OUR

00:04:23.850 --> 00:04:25.385
NEIGHBORHOOD PICKING UP

00:04:24.684 --> 00:04:26.519
EVERYONE.

00:04:25.518 --> 00:04:27.687
THIS IS JUST INSANE.

00:04:26.653 --> 00:04:30.890
THIS IS IMMORAL.

00:04:27.821 --> 00:04:33.026
I CANNOT UNDERSTAND WHO

00:04:31.024 --> 00:04:35.095
ANYBODY, WHO ANYBODY WOULD

00:04:33.159 --> 00:04:38.932
GIVE THE ILLEGAL CRIMINALS

00:04:35.228 --> 00:04:40.166
PROTECTION FROM THE LAW AND

00:04:39.065 --> 00:04:40.667
MORE RIGHTS THAN GIVING TO THE

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:42.602
CITIZENS.

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:45.572
IT'S JUST UNBELIEVABLE.

00:04:42.735 --> 00:04:46.673
CALIFORNIA IS EMOTIONAL.

00:04:45.705 --> 00:04:49.876
GOVERNOR BROWN AND THE MAYOR,

00:04:46.806 --> 00:04:51.578
THE PROGRESSIVE MAYORS AND THE

00:04:50.009 --> 00:04:53.079
LEGISLATORS HAVE LOST SIGHT OF

00:04:51.711 --> 00:04:54.714
DOING THE RIGHT THING.

00:04:53.279 --> 00:04:55.215
&gt;&gt; WELL, MAYOR ABED, YOU ARE

00:04:54.848 --> 00:04:57.117
NOT ALONE.

00:04:55.348 --> 00:04:59.285
I WANT TO PULL UP THIS MAP OF

00:04:57.250 --> 00:05:00.553
OTHER CITIES AND

00:04:59.419 --> 00:05:02.922
MUNICIPALITIES, COUNTIES WHO

00:05:00.687 --> 00:05:04.124
ARE LOOKING AT EITHER PUSHING

00:05:03.056 --> 00:05:04.991
BACK AGAINST SACRAMENTO OR

00:05:04.257 --> 00:05:06.226
ALREADY HAVE.

00:05:05.125 --> 00:05:07.794
THERE IS ALMOST MORE THAN A

00:05:06.359 --> 00:05:09.129
DOZEN OF THEM AT THAT POINT.

00:05:07.927 --> 00:05:13.833
SO CLEARLY LOCAL COMMUNITIES

00:05:09.262 --> 00:05:15.034
ARE LOOKING AT THAT AND SAYING

00:05:13.967 --> 00:05:16.269
WE DON'T WANT TO BE PART OF

00:05:15.168 --> 00:05:17.937
THE LAWS THAT DON'T ALLOW THE

00:05:16.402 --> 00:05:18.671
LOCAL LAW ENFORCEMENT TO WORK

00:05:18.071 --> 00:05:21.908
WITH THE FEDS.

00:05:18.805 --> 00:05:24.711
BUT GOING BACK FOR A MOMENT,

00:05:22.041 --> 00:05:26.379
WHAT DO YOU HAVE TO SAY TO

00:05:24.844 --> 00:05:27.580
THOSE WHO ARE VICTIMS OF

00:05:26.513 --> 00:05:30.283
CRIMES OF CRIMINAL ALIENS WHO

00:05:27.714 --> 00:05:31.784
ARE ALLOWED TO BE OUT ON THE

00:05:30.416 --> 00:05:35.522
STREETS NOW BECAUSE THE NEW

00:05:31.918 --> 00:05:36.689
SANCTION WARE -- SANCTUARY

00:05:35.655 --> 00:05:38.358
STATE LAWS ALLOW THEM TO

00:05:36.823 --> 00:05:38.725
ESCAPE I.C.E. AND RECOMMIT

00:05:38.491 --> 00:05:40.393
CRIMES?

00:05:38.925 --> 00:05:42.128
&gt;&gt; MY RESPONSE TO THAT IS WE

00:05:40.527 --> 00:05:42.996
HAVE UNDOCUMENTED RESIDENTS

00:05:42.262 --> 00:05:43.997
WHO ARE --

00:05:43.196 --> 00:05:46.366
&gt;&gt; OKAY, FIRST OF ALL.

00:05:44.130 --> 00:05:46.733
WHAT IS AN UNDOCUMENTED

00:05:46.499 --> 00:05:48.601
RESIDENT?

00:05:46.866 --> 00:05:49.202
THAT IS NOT A THING.

00:05:48.801 --> 00:05:50.136
&gt;&gt; SOMEONE UNDOCK

00:05:49.335 --> 00:05:52.338
METROPOLITANNED WHO LIVES IN

00:05:50.270 --> 00:05:53.973
THE COMMUNITY -- UNDOCUMENTED

00:05:52.472 --> 00:05:56.009
WHO LIVES IN THE COMMUNITY.

00:05:54.174 --> 00:05:57.777
&gt;&gt; ILLEGAL ALIEN.

00:05:56.209 --> 00:05:59.279
&gt;&gt; YOU CAN REFER TO THEM THAT

00:05:57.911 --> 00:05:59.712
WAY BUT I CALL THEM

00:05:59.412 --> 00:06:01.848
UNDOCUMENTED.

00:05:59.846 --> 00:06:02.782
IT TAKES YEARS FOR PEOPLE TO

00:06:01.981 --> 00:06:04.717
GET CITIZENSHIP STATUS.

00:06:02.916 --> 00:06:05.585
WE HAVE TO REMEMBER WE ARE A

00:06:04.851 --> 00:06:06.786
NATION OF IMMIGRANTS.

00:06:05.785 --> 00:06:08.488
&gt;&gt; THE GUY ON THE OTHER SIDE

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:09.389
OF YOUR SCREEN CAME HERE

00:06:08.621 --> 00:06:10.390
LEGALLY.

00:06:09.589 --> 00:06:18.698
&gt;&gt; IMMIGRATION REFORM TO FIX

00:06:10.523 --> 00:06:19.532
THE PROCESS SO PEOPLE CAN

00:06:18.831 --> 00:06:21.434
LEGALLY BECOME CITIZENS.

00:06:19.732 --> 00:06:22.602
&gt;&gt; I HAVE TO STOP YOU THERE.

00:06:21.568 --> 00:06:23.703
YOU ARE ARGUING THAT THE

00:06:22.735 --> 00:06:25.104
UNITED STATES OF AMERICA THE

00:06:23.836 --> 00:06:26.839
MOST GENEROUS COUNTRY IN WORLD

00:06:25.238 --> 00:06:27.974
PEOPLE ARE UNABLE TO BECOME

00:06:26.973 --> 00:06:28.641
CITIZENS AND STAND UP FOR THE

00:06:28.107 --> 00:06:28.975
CONSTITUTION OF THE UNITED

00:06:28.775 --> 00:06:30.410
STATES.

00:06:29.108 --> 00:06:32.078
THE MAN WHO IS DEBATING YOU

00:06:30.543 --> 00:06:33.313
TONIGHT, MAYOR ABED, DID THAT.

00:06:32.212 --> 00:06:35.248
HE DID THAT FOR HIS COUNTRY.

00:06:33.446 --> 00:06:36.716
SO FOR YOU TO SAY THAT IS

00:06:35.381 --> 00:06:38.284
IMPOSSIBLE TO GET CITIZENSHIP

00:06:36.849 --> 00:06:38.618
JUST IS NOT ON PAR WITH THE

00:06:38.418 --> 00:06:40.553
FACTS.

00:06:38.751 --> 00:06:41.087
MAYOR ABED, DO YOU WANT TO

00:06:40.687 --> 00:06:42.088
RESPOND?

00:06:41.287 --> 00:06:43.690
&gt;&gt; IT'S OFFENSIVE.

00:06:42.222 --> 00:06:48.695
IT'S CLEARLY OFFENSIVE.

00:06:43.823 --> 00:06:52.098
THEY ARE GETTING -- MY TWO

00:06:48.828 --> 00:06:55.001
DAUGHTERS WENT TO THE

00:06:52.232 --> 00:06:56.669
UNIVERSITY OF SAN MARCOS.

00:06:55.134 --> 00:06:58.004
ILLEGAL IMMIGRANTS PAY LESS

00:06:56.803 --> 00:06:59.539
TUITION IN THE SCHOOL SYSTEM.

00:06:58.137 --> 00:07:01.107
THEY ARE GIVEN MORE RIGHTS.

00:06:59.672 --> 00:07:02.542
NOT ONLY EDUCATIONALLY,

